  "job_B3.2.24_20251003_114627": {
    "chunk_text": ". \u00dea cleopedon hie sona, \u00fea Iudeas, ealle ane worde & \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Ne willa\u00fe we \u00feysne, ac we willa\u00fe W\u00e6s se Barrabas haten sum scea\u00fea & forwyrht man, w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fey si\u00f0e on bendum. \u00dea b\u00e6don hie, \u00fea Iudeas, \u00fe\u00e6t him man \u00feone agefe \u00fe\u00e6t hi moston him feorg forgifan. \u00dea heht he, Pilatus, Crist swingan, & hie genamon, \u00fea milite, & geworhton \u00feyrnene coronan & setton \u00dea genamon hie, for \u00fean, bysmernesse, & geworhton \u00fe\u00e6t tacen of \u00feornum & setton on his heafod, & \u00dea genamon hie, for \u00fean, \u00fea bysmernesse, & gegiredon hine, urne dryhten h\u00e6lende Crist, mid reade & hi hine mid hira handum on his wange slogon & him m\u00e6nigfealde bysmernessa dydon. & he \u00fea \u00feis eall, se heofonlica f\u00e6der, ge\u00f0eldelice & eadmodlice for us \u00ferowode & ab\u00e6r. \u00dea eode he, Pilatus, eft ut to Iudeum & him to cw\u00e6\u00f0: Nu gyt ic hine hate l\u00e6dan hider ut beforan eow \u00dea eode he, ure dryhten Crist, ut beforan \u00fea Iudeas. H\u00e6fde he \u00fea \u00feyrnenne coronan on his heafde, & mid \u00feam readan hr\u00e6gle gegyred w\u00e6s. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, Pilatus, to Iudeum: Ecce homo, \u00deis is se man he; ac hata\u00fe hine nu ateon swa swa ge \u00dea hie \u00fea hine gesawon, \u00fea cleopodon hie sona ealle ane worde & \u00feus cw\u00e6don: Crucifige,",
